<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN SCHEDULE FOR SUNDAY.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN SCHEDULE FOR SUNDAY.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schedule of play at the Australian Open on Sunday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Centre Court (2345 GMT start Saturday)</p>
<p>Mary Pierce (France) v 5-Anke Huber (Germany)</p>
<p>Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) v 2-Michael Chang (U.S.)</p>
<p>1-Steffi Graf (Germany) v 12-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa)</p>
<p>7-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) v 9-Marcelo Rios (Chile)</p>
<p>Court One (2400 GMT)</p>
<p>Carlos Moya (Spain) v Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden)</p>
<p>3-Conchita Martinez (Spain) v 16-Sabine Appelmans (Belgium).</p>
</text>
